86399550 1072 #uuid "a81398bc-73ed-504a-b8b3-ef512650d7f6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399550 1074 "First, we rewrite the coefficient of the linear term as a product with $2$ as a factor:\n\n$$\n{y}^{2}-2\\cdot 5y+30\n$$\n\nNow, here's the trick. We *add* and *then subtract* ${5}^{2},$ writing the constant term $30$ last:\n\n$$\n{{y}^{2}-2\\cdot 5y+{5}^{2}}_{⏟}-\\,{5}^{2}+30\n$$\n\nThe first three terms form a perfect square, which we factor as follows:\n\n$$\n(y-5{)}^{2}-{5}^{2}+30\n$$\n\nFinally, evaluating the last two terms, we get\n\n$$\n(y-5{)}^{2}+5.\n$$\n\nTherefore, $p=-5$ and $q=5.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399552 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399553 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399554 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399555 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399556 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399555 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399551 1080 #uuid "c559c184-d951-52c2-ae9b-1fd6b5cd4853" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399552 1081 "p=-5,\\text{ }q=10" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399552 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399552 1084 #uuid "7d53fe67-7a37-5135-9bda-59dc26da7eba" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399553 1081 "p=5,\\text{ }q=5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399553 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399553 1084 #uuid "9b5c7488-0854-5209-9e72-78867a6a1be6" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399554 1081 "p=-10,\\text{ }q=5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [175921863