ly" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399568 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399568 1084 #uuid "028c6bbc-5127-5736-b3ba-9f94a0f28ed4" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399569 1081 "I and II only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399569 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399569 1084 #uuid "3daa75bf-f787-56ff-9dca-1b80759e9c6c" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399570 1081 "II only" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399570 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399570 1084 #uuid "d4912560-949d-5a8e-9911-c20ce554555e" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399572 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1069 "q-142315" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1071 "Find the solution of $-{x}^{2}+6x-5\\le 0.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1072 #uuid "f59dad02-8b17-598a-a754-71bfff242018" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399571 1074 "To solve the inequality \n\n$$\n-{x}^{2}+6x-5\\le 0,\n$$\n\nwe need to find the values of $x$ for which the parabola \n\n$$\ny=-{x}^{2}+6x-5\n$$\n\nlies *below* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nFirst, let's find the roots of the parabola:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}-{x}^{2}+6x-5 & =0 \\\\ -({x}^{2}-6x+5) & =0 \\\\ -(x-1)(x-5) & =0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the roots are $x=1$ and $x=5,$ and we can graph the parabola as follows:\n\n![](images/7c/7cfa66b5aa6a3f29e7154e329926a47bbbb0eb45dce3251148986785f09ee383.png)\n\nThe values marked in blue show all $x$-values where the parabola lies *below* the $x$-axis or touches this axis.\n\nSo, the solution to the inequality is $x\\le 1$ or $x\\ge 5.$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399573 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399574 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399575 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399576 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399577 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399575 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399572 1080 #uuid "8b2ce6b8-4640-53b8-b17b-3464a0fe587d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399573 1081 "-1\\le x\\le 5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399573 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399573 1084 #uuid "bb10726b-626d-526b-b3f9-de6bad9f3f38" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399574 1081 "$x\\le -6$ or $x\\ge 1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399574 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399574 1084 #uuid "a7f8c3f4-5711-584d-9263-fed31acf6c29" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399575 1081 "$x\\le 1$ or $x\\ge 5$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399575 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399575 1084 #uuid "bce75758-abe3-5789-8de5-5d18996c87a5" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1081 "-5\\le x\\le -1" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399576 1084 #uuid "cf8d0e9c-0806-580a-b031-8a01a725abe9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1081 "$x\\le -5$ or $x\\ge 1$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399577 1084 #uuid "a4a43c47-c698-531e-a0a3-0b2da98a2630" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1068 #edb/ref 17592186399579 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1069 "q-142915" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1071 "| $f$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=4$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.25$ | $0.1$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.3$ | $0.15$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.2$ | $0$ |\n\nFind the conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)$ given that the random variables $X$ and $Y$ have the joint probability mass function $f(x,y)$ shown in the table above." 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1072 #uuid "0a2eced6-9cd5-5469-b3dc-6168e1ec698d" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399578 1074 "The conditional probability mass function ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ is defined as\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)=P(X=x\\,|\\,Y=y).\n$$\n\nTherefore, we're required to compute the following set of conditional probabilities:\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)=P(X=x\\,|\\,Y=4)\n$$\n\nBy the multiplication law for conditional probability, we have\n\n$$\nP(X=x\\,|\\,Y=4)=\\frac{P(X=x,Y=4)}{P(Y=1)}=\\frac{f(x,4)}{{f}_{Y}(4)}\n$$\n\nwhere $f(x,y)$ is the joint probability mass function of $X$ and $Y,$ and ${f}_{Y}(y)$ is the marginal distribution of $Y.$\n\nRecall that the marginal distributions for $X$ and $Y$ correspond to the row and column totals, respectively. So, let's compute these:\n\n| $f$ | $Y=2$ | $Y=4$ | ${f}_{X}(x)$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $0.25$ | $0.1$ | $0.35$ |\n| $X=1$ | $0.3$ | $0.15$ | $0.45$ |\n| $X=2$ | $0.2$ | $0$ | $0.2$ |\n| ${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $0.75$ | $0.25$ | $1$ |\n\nTherefore, for $x\\in {0,1,2},$ we obtain:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X=0\\,|\\,Y=4) & =\\frac{f(0,4)}{{f}_{Y}(4)}=\\frac{0.1}{0.25}=0.4 \\\\ P(X=1\\,|\\,Y=4) & =\\frac{f(1,4)}{{f}_{Y}(4)}=\\frac{0.15}{0.25}=0.6 \\\\ P(X=2\\,|\\,Y=4) & =\\frac{f(2,4)}{{f}_{Y}(4)}=\\frac{0}{0.25}=0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nFinally, the conditional probability mass function can be represented by the following table:   \n\n| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)$ | $0.4$ | $0.6$ | $0$ |" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399580 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399581 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399582 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399583 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399584 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399580 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399579 1080 #uuid "2e2d2d25-c810-5851-af0b-d59a08144e7f" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399580 1081 "| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)$ | $0.4$ | $0.6$ | $0$ |" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399580 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399580 1084 #uuid "c4bfd97b-bea2-5ab6-9084-e9f94b5ae836" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1081 "| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)$ | $0.25$ | $0.35$ | $0.4$ |" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399581 1084 #uuid "b14388b2-8f17-5b6d-bd37-dce823b24383" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1081 "| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,4)$ | $0.2$ | $0.5$ | $0.3$ |" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045500 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399582 1084 #uuid "e285d986-7f75-5785-9aea-c3e63564aefe" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399583 1081 "| $x$ | $0$ | $1$ | $2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\