rticular art object **increases** with time. The **rate** of change of the object's value is **proportional** to the **square of the value**.  *\n\nWe note the following:\n\n- The question describes the *rate* at which the *value* varies. Therefore, this is a statement about the quantity \n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}.\n$$\n\n- We're told that $\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}$ is *proportional to* the *value squared.* In other words,\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}∝{V}^{2}.\n$$\n\nRecall that $∝$ means \"is proportional to.\"\n\n- Finally, we want to replace the proportionality symbol with an equality symbol. Let $k$ be a positive constant. Since the value *increases* with time, our derivative should be *positive*. Therefore, we can rewrite our proportionality statement as\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=k{V}^{2}.\n$$" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399594 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399595 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399596 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399597 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1075 #edb/ref 17592186399598 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1077 "selection" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1079 #edb/ref 17592186399597 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399593 1080 #uuid "4527b519-e235-578b-ba4e-e12b67a2bec9" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399594 1081 "\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=-k\\sqrt{V},\\,\\,k>0" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399594 1083 #edb/ref 17592186045499 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399594 1084 #uuid "d1888cd0-9005-51e4-8f23-a9c29cc22081" 13194139533478 17592186045585 true] [17592186399595 1081 "\\frac{\\text{d}V}{\\text{d}t}=k\\sqrt{V},\\,\\,k>0" 131941